      "message": "I made the judgment based on this information when I discovered these logs.\nI InputReader: Device added: id\u003d19, eventHubId\u003d19, name\u003d\u0027Mediatek\u0027, descriptor\u003d\u00279f21dfc094796d4153bea24e1fabef8006453fa0\u0027,sources\u003dKEYBOARD | DPAD\nI InputReader: Device added: id\u003d19, eventHubId\u003d18, name\u003d\u0027Mediatek\u0027, descriptor\u003d\u0027d8bacd9276f9423c37ec789169fc64b3b28f078b\u0027,sources\u003dKEYBOARD | DPAD\n\nThese two added devices are the same, with only different descriptor values. \nThis indicates that the process has completed EventHub.cpp \n\nopenDeviceLocked -\u003e \nassignDescriptorLocked -\u003e \nhasDeviceWithDescriptorLocked.\n\nIn hasDeviceWithDescriptorLocked, there is a check to see if a device with the same descriptor exists, and if it does, a new descriptor value is generated for this same device. \nBased on this judgment, I believe that the duplicate check for mDevices at the start of openDeviceLocked is not sufficient, and a duplicate check for mOpeningDevices needs to be added.",
